# Powerslide (Shift) at 9 m/s: the board swings about 85 degrees across the travel direction in a
# fifth of a second (nose to the heel side: counterclockwise for a regular rider going forward),
# and sliding friction (0.6 g) stops it in about 1.5 s and 7 m.
park lab
cmd 0 teleport -20 -12 0.13 90
cmd 9 speed 9
hold slide 10..240
run 240
expect event powerslide{on=true} within 10..12
expect skater.heading < 10 at 40
expect skater.speed < 1 at 185
expect skater.speed > 1.5 at 160
expect skater.pos.x < -12.5 at end
expect skater.pos.x > -13.5 at end
expect event powerslide{on=false} within 170..200
expect no event bail
